   "h": 110,
   "rot": 0,
   "opacity": 1,
   "animIn": "none",
   "animOut": "none",
   "animDur": 0.45,
   "text": "Doscientos mil pesos.",
   "size": 52,
   "capStyle": "pill",
   "maxWords": 4,
   "accent": "#FF6BA7"
  },
  {
   "id": "l78",
   "type": "caption",
   "name": "Subtítulos 2",
   "start": 2.54,
   "end": 3.97,
   "x": 540,
   "y": 1450,
   "w": 960,
   "h": 110,
   "rot": 0,
   "opacity": 1,
   "animIn": "none",
   "animOut": "none",
   "animDur": 0.45,
   "text": "Por las claves de su página web.",
   "size": 52,
   "capStyle": "pill",
   "maxWords": 4,
   "accent": "#FF6BA7"
  },
  {
   "id": "l79",
   "type": "caption",
   "name": "Subtítulos 3",
   "start": 4.46,
   "end": 7.22,
   "x": 540,
   "y": 1450,
   "w": 960,
   "h": 110,
   "rot": 0,
   "opacity": 1,
   "animIn": "none",
   "animOut": "none",
   "animDur": 0.45,
   "text": "Eso me contó una clienta que quería actualizar su sitio.",
   "size": 52,
   "capStyle": "pill",
   "maxWords": 4,
   "accent": "#FF6BA7"
  },
  {
   "id": "l80",
   "type": "caption",
   "name": "Subtítulos 4",
   "start": 7.74,
   "end": 10.71,
   "x": 540,
   "y": 1450,
   "w": 960,
   "h": 110,
   "rot": 0,
   "opacity": 1,
   "animIn": "none",
   "animOut": "none",
   "animDur": 0.45,
   "text": "Ella solo tenía un usuario con permisos limitados.",
   "size": 52,
   "capStyle": "pill",
   "maxWords": 4,
   "accent": "#FF6BA7"
  },
  {
   "id": "l81",
   "type": "caption",
   "name": "Subtítulos 5",
   "start": 11.18,
   "end": 16.77,
   "x": 540,
   "y": 1450,
   "w": 960,
   "h": 110,
   "rot": 0,
   "opacity": 1,
   "animIn": "none",
   "animOut": "none",
   "animDur": 0.45,
   "text": "Cuando pidió el acceso de administrador, el desarrollador le pidió doscientos mil pesos para entregárselo.",
   "size": 52,
   "capStyle": "pill",
   "maxWords": 4,
   "accent": "#FF6BA7"
  },
  {
   "id": "l82",
   "type": "caption",
   "name": "Subtítulos 6",
   "start": 17.26,
   "end": 21.7,
   "x": 540,
   "y": 1450,
   "w": 960,
   "h": 110,
   "rot": 0,
   "opacity": 1,
   "animIn": "none",
   "animOut": "none",
   "animDur": 0.45,
   "text": "Al final decidió dejar esa página, y conmigo hicimos una nueva desde cero.",
   "size": 52,
   "capStyle": "pill",
   "maxWords": 4,
   "accent": "#FF6BA7"
  },
  {
   "id": "l83",
   "type": "caption",
   "name": "Subtítulos 7",
   "start": 22.22,
   "end": 24.95,
   "x": 540,
   "y": 1450,
   "w": 960,
   "h": 110,
   "rot": 0,
   "opacity": 1,
   "animIn": "none",
   "animOut": "none",
   "animDur": 0.45,
   "text": "Por eso, antes de contratar una web, pregunta:",
   "size": 52,
   "capStyle": "pill",
   "maxWords": 4,
   "accent": "#FF6BA7"
  },
  {
   "id": "l84",
   "type": "caption",
   "name": "Subtítulos 8",
   "start": 25.43,
   "end": 30.99,
   "x": 540,
   "y": 1450,
   "w": 960,
   "h": 110,
   "rot": 0,
   "opacity": 1,
   "animIn": "none",
   "animOut": "none",
   "animDur": 0.45,
   "text": "Si después quiero trabajar con otra persona o cambiar de hosting, ¿puedo hacerlo sin empezar de cero?",
   "size": 52,
   "capStyle": "pill",
   "maxWords": 4,
   "accent": "#FF6BA7"
  },
  {
   "id": "l85",
   "type": "caption",
   "name": "Subtítulos 9",
   "start": 31.48,
   "end": 35.07,
   "x": 540,
   "y": 1450,
   "w": 960,
   "h": 110,
   "rot": 0,
   "opacity": 1,
   "animIn": "none",
   "animOut": "none",
   "animDur": 0.45,
   "text": "Yo te asesoro para que contrates el dominio y el hosting a tu nombre.",
   "size": 52,
   "capStyle": "pill",
   "maxWords": 4,
   "accent": "#FF6BA7"
  },
